        q("What is an app permission?","ऐप की अनुमति क्या है?","యాప్ peruimission అంటే ఏమిటు?","A password","A rule explaining what the app may access","A phone number","A charger","B","A permission explains what information or action the app may use.","अनुमति बताती है कि ऐप कौन सी जानकारी या कार्रवाई का उपयोग कर सकता है।","perimission explain करता है app kya information use kar sakta hai."),
        q("What should you do before accepting permissions?","अनुमतियाँ स्वीकार करने से पहले क्या करें?","peruimission అంగీకరించకముందే ఏమి చేయాలి?","Accept immediately","Read the permission and app name","Share the PIN","Turn off the phone","B","Read the app name and permissions, then decide carefully.","मेरे का नाम और अनुमतियाँ पढ़ें, फिर सावधानी से निर्णय लें।","app name read krna and permissions check karna."),
