        q("What is WhatsApp?","WhatsApp क्या है?","WhatsApp అంటే ఏమిటు?","A password manager","A messaging app","A phone charger","A camera","B","WhatsApp is a messaging and calling app that uses the internet.","WhatsApp इंटरनेट का उपयोग करने वाला मैसेजिंग और कॉलिंग ऐप है।","WhatsApp Internet use karne wala message and calling app hai."),
