        q("What should you do before sharing a photo in a group chat?","ग्रुप चेट में तस्वीर साझा करने से पहले क्या करें?","Group chat లో ఫోటో పంచకముందే ఏమి చేయాలి?","Share it with everyone","Confirm the group and the photo","Share the PIN","Turn off the phone","B","Confirm the group members and check the photo before sharing.","ग्रुप सदस्यों की पुष्टि करें और साझा करने से पहले तस्वीर जांचें।","Group members verify and photo check karo."),
